   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Carlos. Your identity is verified. I found tonight's order, Q-7401 from Taqueria Luz, placed at 6:20 PM and handed off to you at 7:01 PM. The courier's record and your payment record both show the elote was on the order: 1 elote at $5.50.\n\nSince the elote was missing, I can offer you one of these:\n\n1. **Refund of $5.50** to your Visa ending in 4242, or\n2. **Account credit of $6.60** ($5.50 plus 20%) for future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
